   ╔═ Vix ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗    
   ║                                                             ║    
   ║ Your move                                                   ║    
   ║ Over to you. Steer the cursor onto one of your units and    ║    
   ║ pick it up. You can jump straight to whoever can still act, ║    
   ║ and look anyone over to see what you're working with.       ║    
   ║                                                             ║    
   ║ Move the cursor: D-pad/L-stick. Pick up a unit: ✕           ║    
   ║ Next unit to act: R1. A unit's details: △                   ║    
   ║                                                             ║    
   ║ ✕ close                                                     ║    
